  {
   "text": "The six houses from the 7th represent the left side limbs of the Kalapurusha, ",
   "bbox": [
    121,
    516,
    556,
    532
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "while the other six houses i.e. those reckoned from the Ascendant represent right ",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    540,
    556,
    556
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "side limbs.",
   "bbox": [
