    565,
    146,
    580
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "10. [In a birth chart there are twelve house. Each house has been given ",
   "bbox": [
    121,
    589,
    556,
    604
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "several names indicating the various subjects it deals with.]",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    613,
    418,
    628
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "The names by which the first house or the Ascendant is known are Lagna, ",
   "bbox": [
    121,
    637,
    556,
    652
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Hora, Kalya, Deha, Udaya, Rupa, Seersha, Vartmana (present) and Janma.",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    661,
    501,
    677
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "The second house deals with Vitta (wealth), Vidya (learning). Swa, ",
   "bbox": [
    121,
    685,
    556,
    701
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Annapana (riches, food and drinks), Bhukti (eating), the right eye, face (Asya), ",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    709,
    556,
    725
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "letter or document (Patrika), Speech (Vak) and Kutumba (family) and thus adopts ",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    734,
    556,
    749
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "these appellations.",
   "bbox": [
    85,
